@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# Spec Delta
+
+## Purpose
+Shipping cost and the free-shipping rule for orders.
+
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Free shipping from €50.00
+Shipping SHALL be free when the goods come to 5000 cents or more after every discount and before VAT.
+
+#### Scenario: Exactly €50.00
+- **WHEN** goods after discounts are 5000 cents and the parcel weighs 500 g
+- **THEN** shipping is 0 cents
+
+#### Scenario: One cent below
+- **WHEN** goods after discounts are 4999 cents and the parcel weighs 500 g
+- **THEN** shipping is 490 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Above
+- **WHEN** goods after discounts are 5001 cents
+- **THEN** shipping is 0 cents
