+# Spec Delta
+
+## Purpose
+VAT on order lines, rounded per line.
+
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Line VAT rounds half up
+VAT of a line SHALL be its net amount times the class rate, rounded half up to the cent.
+
+#### Scenario: Below half a cent
+- **WHEN** a line nets 199 cents at the standard rate (22%), i.e. 43.78 cents
+- **THEN** its VAT is 44 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Exactly half a cent
+- **WHEN** a line nets 125 cents at the reduced rate (10%), i.e. 12.5 cents
+- **THEN** its VAT is 13 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Just under half a cent
+- **WHEN** a line nets 124 cents at the reduced rate (10%), i.e. 12.4 cents
+- **THEN** its VAT is 12 cents
